                "summary": {
                    "label": "Looking for a game that soothes the soul but keeps your brain spinning? Welcome to Meowdoku \u2014 a pure logic puzzle game that flawlessly blends the rigorous reasoning of Sudoku with the thrilling deduction of Minesweeper.\n\nHere, you have only one mission: find the perfect \"exclusive territory\" for every aloof little cat!\nSimple Rules, Deep Strategy\n\nThe concept is elegant and intuitive, yet anything but simple:\n\u2022 Exclusive Territory: The board is divided into colored sections. You must place exactly one cat in each section.\n\u2022 The Aloof Rule: Cats need absolute personal space! They absolutely cannot share the same row, column, or touch each other\u2014not even diagonally.\n\u2022 Risk & Reward: Double-tap a tile to place a cat. You only have 3 chances to make a mistake (hearts). Guess right, and you're rewarded with pure puzzle-solving satisfaction; guess wrong, and you lose a heart. Guessing won't save you; every single move must be carefully calculated!\n\nKey Features\n\u2022 Pure & Immersive Experience\n\u2022 Non-Intrusive Ads: Zero interruptions to your gameplay, letting you fully enjoy a completely focused, Zen-like flow state.\n\u2022 Play Offline Anytime: No internet required. Perfectly fills up the puzzle-shaped hole in your daily commute, time spent waiting in line, or your morning coffee break.\n\nWake up your mind with brand-new \"Daily Puzzles\" every single day.\nPush your limits and see if you can break your fastest completion times on the global leaderboards. Why Meowdoku Will Stay on Your Phone Meowdoku won't hijack your attention with tedious social mechanics or endless daily grinds\u2014it earns your love through pure gameplay quality. With its minimalist aesthetic and satisfying tactile feedback, it takes just seconds to learn. Yet, long after you put your phone down, its elegant logic loop will keep lingering in your mind. Ready for a brain-teasing puzzle adventure filled with adorable felines? Download Meowdoku now, put your logic to the test, and become the ultimate feline puzzle master!\n\nTerms: https://oakevergames.com/tos.html\nPrivacy Policy: https://oakevergames.com/pp.html\nEULA: https://www.apple.com/legal/internet-services/itunes/dev/stdeula/\nEmail: support@oakevergames.com"
                },
